{"id": "16-1535-2-6", "zh": "这里，**uhasatī**，意思是 avahasati（嘲笑）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1535-7-10", "zh": "**Udasiyamāno**，意思是 avahasiyamāno（被嘲笑）。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "16-1535-11-39", "zh": "这里有圣典文句为证：“在这里，女人走近到林野中、树下或空屋里的比丘，嘲笑他”，以及“他被女人嘲笑”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1535-40-55", "zh": "**Hāso**，指笑或者喜悦，就像“我生起了喜悦”等句中那样。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1536-2-7", "zh": "tusa、hasa、hisa、rasa（词根），表示发声。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1536-8-17", "zh": "tusati、hasati、hisati、rasati、rasitaṃ。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "16-1536-18-33", "zh": "这里有圣典文句为证：“让所有的鼓都敲响，让所有的琵琶都奏鸣。”", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1537-2-4", "zh": "rasa（词根），表示品尝。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1537-5-6", "zh": "rasati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1537-7-8", "zh": "raso（味）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1538-2-4", "zh": "rasa（词根），表示品尝与爱着。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "16-1538-5-6", "zh": "rasati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1538-7-8", "zh": "raso。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "16-1539-2-4", "zh": "rasa（词根），表示减损。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1539-5-6", "zh": "rasati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1539-7-10", "zh": "rasanaṃ、raso（减损）。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1540-2-4", "zh": "这里有圣典文句为证——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1541-2-14", "zh": "“无论是站着、坐着的人，还是躺着、行走的人，", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "16-1542-2-11", "zh": "乃至在一眨眼之间，年寿也在那时消减。”", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "16-1543-2-14", "zh": "这里，**rasatibbayo**，意思是：一个个年岁都在减损、衰退，不会增长。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1544-2-4", "zh": "lasa（词根），表示黏合与嬉戏。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "16-1544-5-6", "zh": "lasati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1544-7-8", "zh": "lāso（嬉戏）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1544-9-13", "zh": "你的脑髓也流了出来。", "confidence": 68}
{"id": "16-1544-14-17", "zh": "lasi 是指脑髓。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1544-18-21", "zh": "**Nippalitā**，意思是流出来了。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1545-2-5", "zh": "nisa（词根），表示定。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1545-6-9", "zh": "定，就是使心安住、心一境性。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "16-1545-10-11", "zh": "nesati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1546-2-7", "zh": "misa、masa（词根），表示发声，也表示愤怒。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "16-1546-8-9", "zh": "mesati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1546-10-11", "zh": "masati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1546-12-13", "zh": "meso（羊）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1546-14-15", "zh": "masako（蚊子）。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "16-1547-2-5", "zh": "pisi、pesu（词根），表示行走。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1547-6-7", "zh": "pisati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1547-8-9", "zh": "pesati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1548-2-4", "zh": "sasu（词根），表示伤害。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1548-5-6", "zh": "sasati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1548-7-8", "zh": "satthaṃ（刀）。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1548-9-12", "zh": "satthaṃ 是指刀剑。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1549-2-4", "zh": "saṃsa（词根），也表示称赞。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1549-5-8", "zh": "“也”（ca）字是为了兼顾“伤害”这个意义。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1549-9-12", "zh": "saṃsati、pasaṃsati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1549-13-16", "zh": "pasaṃsā、pasaṃsanā（称赞）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1549-17-19", "zh": "受称赞的世尊（pasattho bhagavā）。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "16-1549-20-34", "zh": "pasaṃsamāno、pasaṃsito、pasaṃsako、pasaṃsitabbo、pasaṃsanīyo、pāsaṃso、pasaṃsitvā 等等。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "16-1550-2-4", "zh": "disa（词根），表示观看。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1550-5-9", "zh": "它有多种不同的词形——", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1550-10-18", "zh": "“dissati、padissati”等是不及物的。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1550-19-27", "zh": "“passati、dakkhati”等是及物的。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1551-2-7", "zh": "dissatu、passatu、dakkhatu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1551-8-13", "zh": "disseyya、passeyya、dakkheyya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1551-14-19", "zh": "disse、passe、dakkhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1551-20-25", "zh": "dissa、passa、dakkha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1551-26-29", "zh": "adissā、apassā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1551-30-33", "zh": "addā sīdantare nage（看见了西达河之间的群山）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1551-34-39", "zh": "addakkhā、addakkhuṃ、adassuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1551-40-45", "zh": "adassi、apassi、adakkhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1552-2-7", "zh": "dassissati、passissati、dakkhissati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1552-8-13", "zh": "adassissā、apassissā、dakkhissā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1552-14-17", "zh": "应当像这样按现在时、命令式等逐一展开。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1552-18-27", "zh": "在使役形式中，有“dasseti、dassayati”这些词形。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1552-28-35", "zh": "在被动形式中，有“passiyati”等。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1553-2-3", "zh": "disā（方位）。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1553-4-5", "zh": "passo。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1553-6-7", "zh": "passaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1553-8-9", "zh": "passitā。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "16-1553-10-11", "zh": "dassetā。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "16-1553-12-13", "zh": "dassanaṃ。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "16-1553-14-18", "zh": "vipassanā、ñāṇadassana，这些是名词形式。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1553-19-30", "zh": "而在表示目的与不定式的意义上，有“dakkhitāye”这个词形。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1553-31-44", "zh": "因为圣典说：“我们来到这次法会，是为了看看不可战胜的僧团。”", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1553-45-60", "zh": "在这段圣典里，“dakkhitāye”是表示目的或不定式意义的第四格词形。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1553-61-73", "zh": "因此，**dakkhitāye** 的意思应当解作 dassanatthāya（为了观看）或 passituṃ（去看）。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "16-1553-74-80", "zh": "而在 **Disā** 等词中，东方等各个方位也称为 disā（方）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1553-81-82", "zh": "如经中所说——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1554-2-8", "zh": "“四方与四维，", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "16-1555-2-7", "zh": "再加上方与下方，这就是十方；", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "16-1556-2-6", "zh": "龙王住在哪一方？", "confidence": 78}
